{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 14 från S.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 14 by S.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Child poverty", "dok_titel": "Children and young people in social services", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2025/26:442 by Serkan Köse (S),\n\n2025/26:1804 by Aida Birinxhiku and Sofia Skönnbrink (both S),\n\n2025/26:1825 by Aylin Nouri (S),\n\n2025/26:2816 by Maj Karlsson et al. (V) demand 23,\n\n2025/26:3362 by Annika Hirvonen et al. (MP) demand 11,\n\n2025/26:3538 by Malte Tängmark Roos et al. (MP) demand 4 and\n\n2025/26:3645 by Fredrik Lundh Sammeli et al. (S) demand 177.", "notis": "The Riksdag said no to 115 proposals in motions on children and young people in social services. The motions were submitted during the general motion period 2025 and concern, among other things, services for children and young people, placement forms for children and young people as well as the rights of children.\nThe Riksdag refers primarily to the fact that work is already underway within the areas the proposals address.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2025/26:442 by Serkan Köse (S),\n\n2025/26:1804 by Aida Birinxhiku and Sofia Skönnbrink (both S),\n\n2025/26:1825 by Aylin Nouri (S),\n\n2025/26:2816 by Maj Karlsson et al. (V) demand 23,\n\n2025/26:3362 by Annika Hirvonen et al. (MP) demand 11,\n\n2025/26:3538 by Malte Tängmark Roos et al. (MP) demand 4 and\n\n2025/26:3645 by Fredrik Lundh Sammeli et al. (S) demand 177.", "Reservation 14"]}, "votering_id": "6FC00699-0CEC-4744-8F92-97A3EA892093", "rm": "2025/26", 